cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this case study, please cite it as below."
title: "Centromeric heterochromatin of Capra hircus: a sequence-based case study with public data"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Alejo"
    given-names: "Tiago"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/tiagoherrador/capra-hircus-centromeres"
keywords:
  - Capra hircus
  - centromere
  - satellite DNA
  - telomere-to-telomere assembly
  - bioinformatics
abstract: >-
  A personal portfolio case study that analyses the centromeric satellite DNA of the
  telomere-to-telomere goat genome (Wu et al. 2024): scaling of centromere length with
  chromosome size, satellite composition, differences between haplotypes, and
  exploratory variation between breeds. Code under MIT; text and figures under CC BY 4.0.
